  "project_description": "This module hold and show manual the site version information on site or via JSON API.\n\nUsing with the module Site Version Host allow to have an interface with multiple sites information.\n\n This project is simple and lightweight\n\n Similar Projects\n\n Drupal Remote Dashboard \n\n Back to top \n\n Configuration \n Module configuration : /admin/config/system/site-version\n\nHost auto config : /admin/config/system/site-version/host-autoconfig\n\nInfo view : /site-version\n\n Back to top \n\n Configure host (Site Version Host) \n Add sites from /admin/structure/site_version_host/manage/sites/add or Auto configure using auto config url /admin/config/services/site-version-host\n\n Back to top",
